WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:06,910
The four of you are wearing it. If I don’t wear it, you’re crazy.

2
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:07,990
That's a poison gas bank

3
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,030
Anti-scratch clothing is too heavy

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,430
There really is something like what Bai Jingshan said, running half a step slower

5
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:13,870
It’s no use wearing ten layers

6
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:22,460
Then at least put on the mask and listen carefully.

7
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,100
Behind Laolongkou Pupu

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,300
The first level is hidden mines

9
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,740
The second floor is the poison gas library

10
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,800
There are also plainclothes black-haired military officers inside.

11
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,180
Two people stay outside the entrance

12
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:40,940
The rest follow me. I will know where I will be after entering the mountains.
